  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Partner: Holy Ghost Fathers  Project Title:  &apos;Water harvesting for improved hygiene against Covid-19 at Holy Ghost Technical College and economic empowerment of Round Fire Women Group in Sultan Hamud&apos;Project Objective: The project aims at supplying water to over 400 students and staff of Holy Ghost Technical College to help the local community fight the spread of Covid-19 through improved hygiene. The project also seeks to contribute towards economic empowerment of women and boosting food security in the area. Some of the harvested water will be used by the Round Fire Women Group to establish a garden and orchard for the Technical CollegeProject Activities :  Water, Sanitation, Hygiene , tree growing and establishment of vegetable gardens</narrative>
  </description>
